{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18051","headline":"赠刘师服 · 韩愈","name":"赠刘师服","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羡君齿牙牢且洁，大肉硬饼如刀截。\n我今呀豁落者多，所存十余皆兀臲。\n匙抄烂饭稳送之，合口软嚼如牛呞。\n妻儿恐我生怅望，盘中不飣栗与棃。\n祗今年才四十五，後日悬知渐莽卤。\n朱颜皓颈讶莫亲，此外诸余谁更数。\n忆昔太公仕进初，口含两齿无赢余。\n虞翻十三比岂少，遂自惋恨形於书。\n丈夫命存百无害，谁能点检形骸外。\n巨缗东钓傥可期，与子共饱鲸鱼脍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}